# =============================================================================
# static/.htaccess  (copied to public/.htaccess, deployed to public_html)
# Project : Framework_Website_HopemanHorde
# Date    : 2026-10-26
# Purpose : Apache settings for HopemanHorde.com on GoDaddy cPanel hosting.
# Notes   : The HTTPS redirect below stays commented out until a trusted
#           certificate is installed; enabling it earlier would send every
#           visitor to a browser security warning.
# Change log:
#   2026-10-26  0.4.0  Default page, custom 404, no directory listings,
#                      HTTPS redirect prepared (disabled).
# =============================================================================
DirectoryIndex index.html
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
Options -Indexes

# --- HTTPS redirect: enable once a trusted certificate is installed ---------
# RewriteEngine On
# RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off
# RewriteRule ^ https://%{HTTP_HOST}%{REQUEST_URI} [L,R=301]
